  "title": "Pork Chop and Rice Casserole",
  "description": "Grandmothers always know how to make the most comforting foods, like this super-easy pork chop bake with rice and creamy sauce. The meat bakes low and slow for tenderness.",
  "authors": [
    "cdrewcia"
  ],
